<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/>
<view class="page challenges-page qd-theme qd-challenge"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}">
<view class="eyebrow">SMALL STEPS, TOGETHER</view><view class="heading">一起，让改变发生。</view><view class="subtitle">选一个小目标，把坚持变成给自己的礼物。</view><view class="hero dark section"><view class="row top"><view class="grow"><text class="pill dark">轻动城市挑战</text><view class="hero-title">先看奖励，<view>再一起完成目标。</view></view><view class="hero-desc">累计签到，每一天的努力都算数。</view></view><view class="challenge-decoration"><image src="/images/ui/flag.svg"/></view></view><view class="hero-bottom row"><text class="small-text">会员体验卡 · 达标后限时领取</text><text class="pill dark">{{activities.length}} 个挑战</text></view></view>
<view class="service-links section"><button class="btn soft entry-event" data-url="/pages/events/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/events.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>线下活动广场</text></button><button class="btn soft entry-reward" data-url="/pages/reward-tasks/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/gift.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>全部多档奖励</text></button><button class="btn soft entry-team" data-url="/pages/team/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/team.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>寻找小队</text></button><button class="btn soft entry-challenge" data-url="/pages/rank/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/rank.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>签到 · 体重 · 小队榜</text></button></view><view class="segmented section"><button class="segment {{filter === 'all' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="filterChange">全部挑战</button><button class="segment {{filter === 'mine' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="mine" bindtap="filterChange">我参与的</button><button class="segment {{filter === 'reward' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-filter="reward" bindtap="filterChange">待领奖励</button></view><view wx:if="{{!shown.length}}" class="card section"><view class="empty"><text class="empty-title">给自己选一个小目标</text>还没有相关挑战，先从一天的坚持开始。</view><button class="btn soft" data-filter="all" bindtap="filterChange">看看全部挑战</button></view>
<view wx:for="{{shown}}" wx:key="id" class="challenge-display-card theme-{{item.cardTheme}}" data-url="/pages/activity/index?id={{item.id}}" bindtap="go"><view class="challenge-card-head"><text class="challenge-card-tag">{{item.tag}}</text><text class="challenge-card-slots">{{item.remainingSlots}} 份奖励名额剩余</text></view><view class="challenge-card-main"><view class="challenge-card-art"><image class="challenge-card-icon" src="/images/challenges/{{item.cardIcon}}.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="grow"><view class="challenge-card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="challenge-card-subtitle">{{item.subtitle}}</view></view></view><view class="challenge-card-progress-area"><view class="challenge-progress-heading"><text>已坚持 {{item.progress}} / {{item.days}} 天</text><button class="challenge-card-action" data-url="/pages/activity/index?id={{item.id}}" catchtap="go">{{item.cardAction}} ›</button></view><view class="challenge-progress-row"><view class="challenge-progress-track"><view class="challenge-progress-value" style="width:{{item.progressPercent}}%"></view></view><text class="challenge-progress-percent">{{item.progressPercent}}%</text><view class="challenge-progress-end"></view></view></view><view class="challenge-reward-footer"><image class="challenge-reward-symbol" src="/images/ui/gift.svg"/><text>完成赠 {{item.rewardDays}} 天会员 · 每日 3 次模拟识餐</text><text class="challenge-reward-arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="notice section">当前挑战、名额和奖励均为本机模拟数据，用于体验完整流程，不产生真实会员权益。</view><button class="btn ghost mt" data-url="/pages/rank/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/home/shortcuts/rank.png" mode="aspectFit"/><text>看看轻动伙伴的坚持榜 ↗</text></button>
</block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 每一步坚持，都值得被看见</view></view>
